From: A6L bring-up
Subject: [PATCH] Input: edt-ft5x06 - A6L: FT8719 TDDI follows the LCD, lifts stale contacts

wake-touch-20261011: the FT8719 touch half only scans while the LCD half is up and is reset with it at
every screen-on. Follow the LCD panel (drm_panel_follower), lift every contact at LCD off/on, read nothing
while the LCD is off, drop settle/replay frames after power-on, lift slots missing from a frame, drop
implausible frames and run the vendor point report check (200 ms). focaltech,ft8719 only.

--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.c	2026-10-11 09:06:31.153438700 +0200
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.c	2026-10-11 09:06:31.172450600 +0200
